<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Bank</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>deposit &lt;amount&gt; &lt;coins&gt;
withdraw &lt;amount&gt; &lt;coins&gt;
<a cmd='#'>balance</a>
exchange &lt;amount&gt; &lt;coins&gt; [to &lt;coins&gt;]
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>deposit 30 copper pieces
balance
withdraw 10 iron pieces
exchange 1 gold piece to iron pieces
exchange 40 iron pieces
</pre>
<p>When you die all your money and equipment remains in your corpse while your soul 
travels to Valhalla. You can however deposit money in a bank to ensure that your 
hard earned cash is not lost by theft or death. The bankers are Smith in 
Mammon's Nest in Udgaard, and Bob in Midgaard.
</p><p>The banker takes 5% when you deposit money and when you exchange coins; taking 
money out is free. Remember, you must have money on your character to train, 
take things out of storage, buy items, and so on.
</p><p>Exchange without "to" changes your coins into the largest coins they make, 
with change in smaller ones.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Money</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Purse</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Storage</a>
</pre>




</div>